Z||000003||Oreif||05-05-2001||06:53 AM||||You can run it with the cap off for a few minutes as long as it is cool. Don't try to open the system when hot. With the cap off you have about 5 minutes before things start to heat.||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||05-05-2001||10:04 PM||||Up to and including the cap off part MUST be done with the engine and cooling system Cold.<P>That step will break loose the big air trapped in the head. Should only take a minute or 3.<P>Add more coolant if need be then proceed down the list.||||reg||1
